`dresscode/nette-style`
=======================

Rozvržení kódu podle Nette Coding Standardu: PER s tabulátory a odchylkami, které Nette dělá; o tom, která pravidla projekt zapíná, neříká nic, odsazení tabulátorem, konec řádku podle souboru. Pravidel celkem: 22.

- `array-spacing`
- [binary-operator-spacing |rules/binary-operator-spacing] `operatorPosition: start`
- [blank-lines |rules/blank-lines] `beforeNamespace: 1, afterOpeningTag: keep, afterNamespace: 1, afterImports: 1, betweenImportGroups: 0, beforeDeclaration: 2, betweenDeclarations: [1, 2], betweenMethods: 2, betweenMethodsInInterface: 1, betweenMembers: [0, 1], beforeDocumentedMember: 1, afterPhpDoc: 0, afterBlockBrace: 0`
- [braces-position |rules/braces-position] `multiLineParameters: nextLineAfterReturnType, emptyBodies: ownLine, singleLineAnonymousFunctions: allowed`
- `class-definition-spacing` `beforeParenthesis: single`
- `comma-spacing` `alignment: tabs`
- `comment-spacing`
- `concat-spacing` `operatorPosition: start`
- `construct-spacing` `allowMultiLineExpression: false`
- `double-colon-spacing`
- `indentation` `chain: nesting`
- `multi-line-array` `shape: keep, maxWidth: 110`
- `multi-line-chain` `leadingLinks: sameLine`
- `multi-line-condition` `shape: [perLine, compact], operatorPosition: start`
- `multi-line-signature` `promotedProperties: ownLines`
- `object-operator-spacing`
- `offset-bracket-spacing`
- `phpdoc-alignment`
- `semicolon-spacing` `after: single, allowOwnLine: false`
- `strict-types-required` `placement: openingTagLine`
- `ternary-operator-spacing` `spacing: single, operatorPosition: start`
- [trailing-comma |rules/trailing-comma] `multiLine: [arrays, arguments, parameters]`


